// Soup kitchen world checks: opt-in assertions, not behaviour or effects.
// Teaches: a single holder has at most one content value; identical food types may have different holders.
// Source: original checks for this repository's soup_kitchen host contract (holding is single-valued).
// Licence: same as this repository; no external source text copied.
// Deviations: checks only holding cardinality, not recipe feasibility or all host invariants.
// Not ported: no source validator; missing holdings are allowed for partial/negative test worlds.
// Facts: (holding ?holder ?content), written by the fixture and host after each completed interaction.
// Strategy: reject contradictory contents; an empty plan means the check passed, no_plan means invalid.
// Primitives: none. Helpers: none. No fallback: rejection is intentional.
(:domain SoupKitchenChecks top_level_domain
    (:method (one_content_per_holder) top_level_method
        (valid
            (and
                (not (and
                    (holding ?holder ?a)
                    (holding ?holder ?b)
                    (!= ?a ?b)
                ))
            )
            ()
        )
    )
)
